OL,3,GNEWSA'I want prisoners to know they are
OL,4,Anot lost forever'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA prison chaplain has said how he wants
OL,7,Fto offer inmates the opportunity to
OL,8,Fseek forgiveness.
OL,10,FAlex Day, who works at a Surrey prison,
OL,11,Fsaid his job is to "walk alongside
OL,12,Fprisoners... to help them overcome the
OL,13,Fchallenges of being in prison".
OL,15,F"If I commit a crime and go to jail...
OL,16,Fthat does not mean I should be lost
OL,17,Fforever," he said.
OL,19,FDay, an Anglican, told the BBC his work
OL,20,Fin the prison largely involves
OL,21,Fface-to-face conversations with
OL,22,Fprisoners.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
